"That’s how a mendicant who develops and cultivates the seven awakening factors slants, slopes, and inclines to extinguishment.”"@en owl:sameAs "That’s how a mendicant who develops and cultivates the seven awakening factors slants, slopes, and inclines to extinguishment.”"@en .

