"The text's own words for the relation, verbatim from the cited English (Sujato). S14 checks it occurs in a cited passage."@en owl:sameAs "The text's own words for the relation, verbatim from the cited English (Sujato). S14 checks it occurs in a cited passage."@en .

"There are the sense fields of sights, sounds, smells, tastes, touches, and ideas."@en owl:sameAs "There are the sense fields of sights, sounds, smells, tastes, touches, and ideas."@en .

"There are these seven awakening factors that are not obstacles, hindrances, or corruptions of the mind. When developed and cultivated they lead to the realization of the fruit of knowledge and freedom."@en owl:sameAs "There are these seven awakening factors that are not obstacles, hindrances, or corruptions of the mind. When developed and cultivated they lead to the realization of the fruit of knowledge and freedom."@en .

"There is the feature of ugliness."@en owl:sameAs "There is the feature of ugliness."@en .

"There is the heart’s release by love."@en owl:sameAs "There is the heart’s release by love."@en .

"There is the settled mind."@en owl:sameAs "There is the settled mind."@en .

"These are the five corruptions of the mind. When the mind is corrupted by these it’s not pliable, workable, or radiant. It’s brittle, and not rightly immersed in samādhi for the ending of defilements.”"@en owl:sameAs "These are the five corruptions of the mind. When the mind is corrupted by these it’s not pliable, workable, or radiant. It’s brittle, and not rightly immersed in samādhi for the ending of defilements.”"@en .

"These are the five obstacles and hindrances, corruptions of the heart that weaken wisdom."@en owl:sameAs "These are the five obstacles and hindrances, corruptions of the heart that weaken wisdom."@en .

"These five hindrances are destroyers of sight, vision, and knowledge. They block wisdom, they’re on the side of distress, and they don’t lead to extinguishment."@en owl:sameAs "These five hindrances are destroyers of sight, vision, and knowledge. They block wisdom, they’re on the side of distress, and they don’t lead to extinguishment."@en .

"These seven awakening factors are creators of vision and knowledge. They grow wisdom, they’re on the side of solace, and they lead to extinguishment."@en owl:sameAs "These seven awakening factors are creators of vision and knowledge. They grow wisdom, they’re on the side of solace, and they lead to extinguishment."@en .

"These seven awakening factors are creators of vision and knowledge. They grow wisdom, they’re on the side of solace, and they lead to extinguishment.”"@en owl:sameAs "These seven awakening factors are creators of vision and knowledge. They grow wisdom, they’re on the side of solace, and they lead to extinguishment.”"@en .

"These seven awakening factors, when developed and cultivated, lead solely to disillusionment, dispassion, cessation, peace, insight, awakening, and extinguishment.”"@en owl:sameAs "These seven awakening factors, when developed and cultivated, lead solely to disillusionment, dispassion, cessation, peace, insight, awakening, and extinguishment.”"@en .

"These seven awakening factors, when developed and cultivated, lead to going from the near shore to the far shore."@en owl:sameAs "These seven awakening factors, when developed and cultivated, lead to going from the near shore to the far shore."@en .

"They develop the awakening factor of equanimity, which relies on seclusion, fading away, and cessation, and ripens as letting go."@en owl:sameAs "They develop the awakening factor of equanimity, which relies on seclusion, fading away, and cessation, and ripens as letting go."@en .

